OL,3,GNEWSAThousands sign petition against
OL,4,Aproposed data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans to build a data
OL,8,Fcentre at a business park.
OL,10,FThis summer an early-stage plan emerged
OL,11,Fto build a data centre at Thames Valley
OL,12,FPark in Earley, on the outskirts of
OL,13,FReading, which would replace three
OL,14,Foffice buildings occupied by Microsoft.
OL,16,FThe plan was exhibited at a public
OL,17,Fconsultation in July, with some people
OL,18,Fexpressing concerns about the resource
OL,19,Fdemands and environmental impacts it
OL,20,Fcould have.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
